          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കേടുപാട് (kēṭupāṭŭ) is a native Dravidian compound of കേട്, damage or loss (DEDR 1942), and പാട്, a mark."
            }
          ]
        },
