              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ബുദ്ധിമുട്ട് (buddhimuṭṭŭ) is a Malayalam compound built from ബുദ്ധി, the mind, from Sanskrit buddhi (Monier-Williams), and the native മുട്ട്, an impediment or stoppage (DEDR 4933)."
